# Enhanced Hospital Management System — Upgrade Plan

Your current project is a strong OOP-based beginner/intermediate system. To make it more **functional, scalable, professional, and industry-level**, you can transform it into a complete Hospital Management System (HMS).


# 1. Major Problems in Current Project

Current limitations:

* No permanent data storage
* No login/authentication
* Fixed-size patient array
* No patient search/update/delete
* No appointments
* No billing
* No emergency handling
* No file/database integration
* Console-only interface
* No reports/statistics
* Weak validation
* No role management

